l to a star 100 light years away, I simple cause the universe to cease to exist. Then I recreate it  exactly as it was, except that the star is here.<P> Bingo, I can travel 100 light years in 2 seconds.<P> Now all I have to do is work out the implementaion details on the creation/uncreation system.||||reg||10
